{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/Hanno-logo.png?t=1709753797\" /><br>In this third-person action-adventure game, the player takes on the role of Vimal, a young and rebellious boy who meets Hanno, an unusual elephant. This unexpected encounter triggers a series of challenges that both must face together. It\u2019s a mysterious, heartfelt, story-driven game that you will not soon forget.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/Uniquedynamics-2.png?t=1709753797\" /><br>Engage with how the relationship between Vimal and Hanno evolves, unlocking new abilities and rewards.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/exciting-blend-2.png?t=1709753797\" /><br>From infected soldiers to diabolic creatures, engage in combat or use stealth tactics, all with an elephant on your back.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/stealth_curto_gif.gif?t=1709753797\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/Mystery__1_.png?t=1709753797\" /><br>Find the clues, talk to whimsical and unforgettable characters, solve some puzzles and discover the mystery surrounding Hanno.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/Magical-2.png?t=1709753797\" /><br>Immerse yourself in the magical reality of Ashar\u2019s universe: from exotic and rich settings, somewhat inspired by Southeast Asia and great ancient civilizations like Mesopotamia, to darker and fantastical scenarios.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/sculpture.gif?t=1709753797\" />","background"